Package: com.zema.zgta-v.trollstore
Name: ZGTA V (TrollStore installer)
Version: 0.91-1
Architecture: all
Section: Applications
Maintainer: ZEMA
Author: zema
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), curl, coreutils
Description: Build 91 English-only and Game Files candidate installer. Downloads the pinned ZGTA V IPA and installs it using your existing TrollStore helper. Requires compatible TrollStore or TrollStore Lite. Game files are supplied separately. Removing this installer does not delete the TrollStore app or its data.
